nt entity\", \"different sense\" or \"different time\" only when the identifying details, senses or dates shown really differ, or the explanation shows it; do not assume a difference that is not stated. If the answers are about the same thing in the same sense and cannot both be true, it is a contradiction.\n\nReply with JSON only, in this form:\n{\"reason\": \"one sentence\", \"relation\": \"\"}"
